### French Piper voices (fr-FR)

These three voices were contributed to the app by PierreCsn (#477) and are
downloaded from the upstream sherpa-onnx release at runtime. This repository
contains no voice weights, and Hermes Vox does not modify them or redistribute
them — the app only downloads the unmodified artifact onto the user's phone.

  - **Siwis** — CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
    Dataset named by the card: the SIWIS French speech database, University of
    Edinburgh — https://datashare.is.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/2353
    Model card: https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices/blob/main/fr/fr_FR/siwis/medium/MODEL_CARD
    One speaker.

  - **Tom** — AGPLv3 (https://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0.html).
    Dataset/model named by the card: https://git.bksp.space/Tjiho/French-tts-model-piper
    Model card: https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices/blob/main/fr/fr_FR/tom/medium/MODEL_CARD
    One speaker. (An earlier draft of this work labelled it CC0; the card says
    AGPLv3 and that is the claim this file and the catalogue make.)

  - **UPMC** — CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).
    Dataset named by the card: MaryTTS UPMC Pierre data —
    https://github.com/marytts/upmc-pierre-data
    Model card: https://huggingface.co/rhasspy/piper-voices/blob/main/fr/fr_FR/upmc/medium/MODEL_CARD
    Two speakers (jessica, pierre).
  - Gemma 4 E2B (Google) — Gemma Terms of Use

LiteRT-LM, the on-device runtime that loads Gemma, is distributed through Google Maven and
carries its own licence; the F-Droid recipe's `License` field covers the app only
(`GPL-3.0-only`).
